// Inline skates. Same inputs as the skateboard (see skateboard.ron). Flips are spins and
// inverts of the skater (body_spin / body_flip); grabs reach for a skate; grinds set the
// skates across (angle) or along the rail with the soul plate (tilt).
(
    name: "Inline Skates",
